// between familiar places: the inner local cases (kus? -s, kuhu? -sse / poodi, kooli, kinno, koju, kust? -st) and the
// outer ones (-l, -le, -lt: laual, tööle, turult; õues and arsti juures as frequent exceptions), the postpositions of
// place (kõrval, vastas, lähedal, taga) and the neighbourhood. Harno A2 formats: a listening with 1–2-word answers
// (read twice), an advert and a notice to read, a message of 40–60 words, describing one's home and district.
